usage: rebis.serpentrod [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin]
                        {predict,classify,finger,process,fold,foldv2,spectrum,list}
                        ...

Protein design & stratified prediction (advanced v2)

positional arguments:
  {predict,classify,finger,process,fold,foldv2,spectrum,list}
    predict             Full stratified prediction pipeline
    classify            Classify module type
    finger              Match protein fingerprint
    process             Enhanced processing prediction (v5)
    fold                SerpentRod v1 RNA→protein folding
    foldv2              Native protein glut, full AA self-marks and PDB
                        readout
    spectrum            Primitive activation spectrum
    list                List available tools

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
